# Regression: `std.json.Node` methods (`field`, `text`) called from an imported
# module used to compile but silently return nothing. Codegen dispatches a struct
# method only when `struct_methods` has the struct; semantic registers it on
# first inference, which never runs for an imported module body. Registering
# module-cache struct methods before HIR lowering fixes it.

module h from "./json_module_import_helper.doxa"

entry function main() { @print("plan={h.read()}\n") }
